<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Lucida Fax"><font size="18"><font color="#ffffff"><b>what were you gazing at?</b></font></font></font></font>

37
00:01:33,990 --> 00:01:38,620
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">Sea Battle</font>

38
00:01:33,990 --> 00:01:38,620
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">The Released Power</font>

39
00:01:45,540 --> 00:01:47,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So, you're a monster, too!</font>

40
00:01:48,330 --> 00:01:50,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're one to be acting
like you are above me!</font>

41
00:01:53,590 --> 00:01:54,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Take this!</font>

42
00:01:59,800 --> 00:02:00,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?!</font>

43
00:02:04,930 --> 00:02:05,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Crap!</font>

44
00:02:42,220 --> 00:02:42,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is bad!</font>

45
00:02:43,300 --> 00:02:44,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto!</font>

46
00:02:46,430 --> 00:02:47,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm counting on you...</font>

47
00:03:01,700 --> 00:03:03,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto! Hang in there.</font>

48
00:03:04,030 --> 00:03:04,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto!</font>

49
00:03:10,790 --> 00:03:12,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm okay...</font>

50
00:03:13,250 --> 00:03:15,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Isaribi... Thank you.</font>

51
00:03:27,350 --> 00:03:28,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, no!</font>

52
00:03:28,220 --> 00:03:29,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll take the rest of your Chakra!</font>

53
00:03:30,390 --> 00:03:31,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Mind Destruction Jutsu!</font>

54
00:03:32,810 --> 00:03:33,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Impossible!</font>

55
00:03:38,230 --> 00:03:39,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Made it in time...</font>

56
00:03:44,030 --> 00:03:44,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?!</font>

57
00:03:45,950 --> 00:03:48,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I see... It was you, huh?!</font>

58
00:03:53,580 --> 00:03:55,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The nerve of you to mess with me!</font>

59
00:03:55,330 --> 00:03:56,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Stop it, get away!</font>

60
00:04:06,180 --> 00:04:07,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't turn your back to the enemy...!</font>

61
00:04:09,680 --> 00:04:11,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You forgot the ironclad rule
of the fight...</font>

62
00:04:12,520 --> 00:04:13,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You lose!</font>

63
00:04:21,740 --> 00:04:22,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You saved me...</font>

64
00:04:27,530 --> 00:04:29,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That brat hit me with all his strength...</font>

65
00:04:32,330 --> 00:04:34,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And that Yoroi is no good either.</font>

66
00:04:42,550 --> 00:04:44,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I caught a huge fish!</font>

67
00:04:45,840 --> 00:04:47,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You mean you're going
to escape alone?</font>

68
00:05:00,820 --> 00:05:03,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We completed accommodating
all the injured soldiers.</font>

69
00:05:05,610 --> 00:05:06,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Good work!</font>

70
00:05:07,570 --> 00:05:08,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's left is...</font>

71
00:05:09,330 --> 00:05:11,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto and others, right?</font>

72
00:05:19,340 --> 00:05:21,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Of your numerous crimes...</font>

73
00:05:21,920 --> 00:05:24,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">When we return to the village
justice will be served,</font>

74
00:05:24,220 --> 00:05:25,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and it won't be quick,
so prepare yourself.</font>

75
00:05:26,930 --> 00:05:28,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's not over yet...</font>

76
00:05:28,640 --> 00:05:32,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You! I haven't hit you enough yet!</font>

77
00:05:34,730 --> 00:05:36,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's too bad.</font>

78
00:05:36,850 --> 00:05:37,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?!</font>

79
00:05:50,320 --> 00:05:52,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What... What's going on?</font>

80
00:05:54,120 --> 00:05:58,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Sea Monster doesn't die.
It is immortal, that one!</font>

81
00:06:04,090 --> 00:06:07,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">For the Sea Monster,
this limitless seawater is its life...</font>

82
00:06:07,760 --> 00:06:10,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In the end, it will be your loss!</font>

83
00:06:10,970 --> 00:06:11,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shut up!</font>

84
00:06:15,350 --> 00:06:16,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Summoning Jutsu!</font>

85
00:06:36,330 --> 00:06:38,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All right! I'm counting on you, Chief.</font>

86
00:06:38,830 --> 00:06:41,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Go clobber that flabby guy!</font>

87
00:06:45,300 --> 00:06:48,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, Chief! We don't have time
for you to be so leisurely!</font>

88
00:06:48,510 --> 00:06:50,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That monster...
Whack him in one go...</font>

89
00:06:52,720 --> 00:06:54,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's hot! Hot, hot!</font>

90
00:07:01,560 --> 00:07:04,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You got no business getting
so motivated all by yourself!</font>

91
00:07:06,610 --> 00:07:11,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It itches, itches
and I'm getting a rash all over my body!</font>

92
00:07:11,240 --> 00:07:13,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wait, wait.
Don't come over here, Naruto!</font>

93
00:07:16,450 --> 00:07:17,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn him...</font>

94
00:07:18,040 --> 00:07:20,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm going to rip you apart
when the mission is over!</font>

95
00:07:20,160 --> 00:07:21,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Remember that!</font>

96
00:07:21,330 --> 00:07:25,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto! How are you going
to settle this?!</font>

97
00:07:25,380 --> 00:07:28,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">How can you say that,
Chief Toad is the strongest frog!</font>

98
00:07:28,840 --> 00:07:31,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Please don't let something like
the salt water bother you and fight.</font>

99
00:07:33,220 --> 00:07:37,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You can't even control
the summoned animal you called up!</font>

100
00:07:37,140 --> 00:07:38,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What was that?!</font>

101
00:07:38,890 --> 00:07:40,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you don't send him home quickly</font>

102
00:07:40,730 --> 00:07:45,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">the Sea Monster will gulp him down
and he'll whither like a slug!</font>

103
00:07:45,560 --> 00:07:47,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A slug, he says?!</font>

104
00:07:48,190 --> 00:07:51,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, Naruto! I'm going to
kick your butt later...</font>

105
00:07:51,530 --> 00:07:52,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Right now, I'll help you.</font>

106
00:07:53,030 --> 00:07:54,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh? For real?!</font>

107
00:07:54,570 --> 00:07:57,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't mess with amphibians...</font>

108
00:07:57,240 --> 00:07:59,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll show you my terror!</font>

109
00:08:00,620 --> 00:08:03,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah! Now you're talking.</font>

110
00:08:03,210 --> 00:08:05,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hang on!</font>

111
00:08:09,800 --> 00:08:11,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What the...?</font>

112
00:08:11,300 --> 00:08:14,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You rat... Let go of me, huh!</font>

113
00:08:15,340 --> 00:08:17,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What is this? He got you, Chief Toad!</font>

114
00:08:17,970 --> 00:08:19,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You be quiet!</font>

115
00:08:24,270 --> 00:08:26,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Upsy!</font>

116
00:08:33,740 --> 00:08:36,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This isn't accomplishing anything...</font>

117
00:08:36,410 --> 00:08:39,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's up with
that flabby bastard, really?</font>

118
00:08:41,250 --> 00:08:43,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In short, this is some kind of monster</font>

119
00:08:43,580 --> 00:08:48,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">consisting of water gathered around
its spiritual body at the core.</font>

120
00:08:48,750 --> 00:08:50,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Crap!</font>

121
00:08:50,250 --> 00:08:51,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I don't really know what that means,</font>

122
00:08:51,840 --> 00:08:53,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">but I guess I can't do anything
about that thing.</font>

123
00:08:53,170 --> 00:08:55,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Even though we pierce the monster
with a dagger all we want,</font>

124
00:08:55,510 --> 00:08:58,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">the monster will suck up ocean water
and come back to life...</font>

125
00:08:58,550 --> 00:09:00,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then what should we do,
Chief Toad?!</font>

126
00:09:01,020 --> 00:09:02,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The only thing we can do here is</font>

127
00:09:02,850 --> 00:09:05,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">to somehow damage
the spiritual body at the "core."</font>

128
00:09:05,980 --> 00:09:08,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damage...? How?</font>

129
00:09:09,020 --> 00:09:11,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The opponent is a clump of water...</font>

130
00:09:11,230 --> 00:09:14,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Add heat and he'll evaporate!</font>

131
00:09:15,990 --> 00:09:18,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The thoughts of fools mean nothing...</font>

132
00:09:19,240 --> 00:09:23,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The only thing you can do is to
surrender to me, I who control the ocean!</font>

133
00:09:29,340 --> 00:09:33,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn. You're annoying.
Let's go, Naruto!</font>

134
00:09:33,710 --> 00:09:35,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What? Go? Where are you going?!</font>

135
00:09:36,010 --> 00:09:39,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Airhead! I'll spew oil!</font>

136
00:09:46,270 --> 00:09:49,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Light a fire with
a Fire Style Jutsu!</font>

137
00:09:49,440 --> 00:09:52,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?! I can't do
a Fire Style Jutsu!</font>

138
00:09:53,030 --> 00:09:54,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Here we go!</font>

139
00:09:54,570 --> 00:09:56,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What? Fire, fire, fire!</font>

140
00:10:01,910 --> 00:10:03,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">How's that?!</font>

141
00:10:11,340 --> 00:10:12,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?!</font>

142
00:10:14,550 --> 00:10:16,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He did it...!</font>

143
00:10:17,010 --> 00:10:17,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well done!</font>

144
00:10:19,300 --> 00:10:20,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto...</font>

145
00:10:20,930 --> 00:10:22,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Im... Impossible!</font>

146
00:10:23,220 --> 00:10:24,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We did it, Chief Toad!</font>

147
00:10:25,680 --> 00:10:27,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">How's that!</font>

148
00:10:27,850 --> 00:10:31,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Me and Chief Toad are
the strongest combination, after all!</font>

149
00:10:31,860 --> 00:10:34,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto! You're in a festive mood
all by yourself,</font>

150
00:10:34,730 --> 00:10:37,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">though I'm wondering if
you've forgotten about something?</font>

151
00:10:37,490 --> 00:10:39,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh? Forgotten what?</font>

152
00:10:39,610 --> 00:10:42,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You called me to a place like this...</font>

153
00:10:43,080 --> 00:10:46,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Look, now I've got all of
these goose bumps!</font>

154
00:10:46,370 --> 00:10:49,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You've always had all those warts...</font>

155
00:10:49,330 --> 00:10:53,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shut up! I'll have you
settle this properly!</font>

156
00:10:54,040 --> 00:10:57,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?! Wha...?
Wait Chief Toad! Wait!</font>

157
00:10:57,170 --> 00:10:59,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No use talking!</font>

158
00:11:06,140 --> 00:11:08,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It itches. I can't take it!</font>

159
00:11:08,730 --> 00:11:12,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Something like this
doesn't soothe my feelings but,</font>

160
00:11:12,100 --> 00:11:16,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">my sons have caused you inconvenience,
so I forgive you this time.</font>

161
00:11:18,240 --> 00:11:19,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">See you!</font>

162
00:11:22,530 --> 00:11:27,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm sorry, Chief Toad... Help me...</font>

163
00:11:39,260 --> 00:11:42,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Now that we also got rid of
the Sea Monster, Amachi...</font>

164
00:11:43,180 --> 00:11:45,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You'll be taken to
the Village Hidden in the Leaves</font>

165
00:11:45,930 --> 00:11:47,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">as the principle offender
of the attacks on ships collecting funds.</font>

166
00:11:48,220 --> 00:11:52,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shame! We had gotten kicked
around because of you!</font>

167
00:11:54,360 --> 00:11:57,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What are you doing?!
Isaribi, kill these guys!</font>

168
00:12:01,700 --> 00:12:02,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I won't!</font>

169
00:12:02,820 --> 00:12:03,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Have you forgotten?</font>

170
00:12:04,410 --> 00:12:07,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I am the only person
who can turn you back into a human!</font>

171
00:12:07,530 --> 00:12:08,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If I continue doing this,</font>

172
00:12:08,740 --> 00:12:11,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll be a monster all the way
to my heart!</font>

173
00:12:11,960 --> 00:12:14,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's right, Isaribi!</font>

174
00:12:19,510 --> 00:12:23,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're neither a human being
nor fully integrated like me.</font>

175
00:12:24,590 --> 00:12:27,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The best you can do is to live
the rest of your life as a monster</font>

176
00:12:27,180 --> 00:12:28,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">for your whole life!</font>

177
00:12:30,100 --> 00:12:31,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well, from the very start,</font>

178
00:12:31,600 --> 00:12:34,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I hadn't thought of a way
to turn you back into a human!</font>

179
00:12:36,440 --> 00:12:37,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Like I told you...</font>

180
00:12:39,360 --> 00:12:42,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I was intending to dissect you!</font>

181
00:12:42,650 --> 00:12:43,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No way...</font>

182
00:12:44,030 --> 00:12:45,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You!</font>

183
00:12:45,700 --> 00:12:47,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">How rotten are you?!</font>

184
00:12:50,490 --> 00:12:51,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Stop it.</font>

185
00:12:52,410 --> 00:12:56,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Once we've returned to the village,
he'll be punished harshly.</font>

186
00:13:04,720 --> 00:13:07,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well... It's about time you told us.</font>

187
00:13:09,680 --> 00:13:12,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Where... did Orochimaru go?</font>

188
00:13:16,060 --> 00:13:17,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You think I know something
like that?!</font>

189
00:13:21,030 --> 00:13:22,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You were tossed aside
by Orochimaru.</font>

190
00:13:22,990 --> 00:13:24,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It serves you right to follow
after him forever.</font>

191
00:13:26,410 --> 00:13:28,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You and I are different!</font>

192
00:13:28,530 --> 00:13:30,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll be in charge of the research center</font>

193
00:13:30,370 --> 00:13:33,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and someday will become an entity
that'd bring Orochimaru to shame.</font>

194
00:13:35,790 --> 00:13:36,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Really...</font>

195
00:13:41,800 --> 00:13:44,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Just for yourself. Not fair!</font>

196
00:13:44,210 --> 00:13:47,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And now, mission completed.
Let's return to the island!</font>

197
00:13:48,300 --> 00:13:50,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Not fair. I'm also slug
a good one before that.</font>

198
00:13:50,640 --> 00:13:51,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Stop it!</font>

199
00:14:08,740 --> 00:14:11,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's the Jiro Island
Amachi was talking about...</font>

200
00:14:13,120 --> 00:14:16,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Here is the source of my nightmare...</font>

201
00:14:17,500 --> 00:14:20,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This place is where the fragments
of my missing memories are left.</font>

202
00:15:36,120 --> 00:15:39,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Orochimaru-sama...
What in the world did you...?</font>

203
00:16:15,740 --> 00:16:16,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">She's alive...!</font>

204
00:16:19,540 --> 00:16:21,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">She's a lucky girl...</font>

205
00:16:22,710 --> 00:16:26,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">After we tested ten,
only one survived...</font>

206
00:16:27,290 --> 00:16:31,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I guess this experiment yielded
a little something before I take my leave.</font>

207
00:16:32,800 --> 00:16:33,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Leave...?</font>

208
00:16:34,180 --> 00:16:37,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Because it looks like
there's no reason to be here anymore...</font>

209
00:16:38,060 --> 00:16:40,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But, the research is still...</font>

210
00:16:41,310 --> 00:16:45,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That facility, do with it
whatever you want.</font>

211
00:16:46,440 --> 00:16:49,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I have no need for it anymore...</font>

212
00:16:53,740 --> 00:16:56,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Why...? How could you do this?
— Why...? How could you do this?</font>

213
00:16:57,700 --> 00:17:01,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— I always respected you, yet you...
— I always respected you, yet you...</font>

214
00:17:08,210 --> 00:17:10,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're lacking many things.</font>

215
00:17:11,000 --> 00:17:13,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Motivation to desire the "power"...</font>

216
00:17:14,510 --> 00:17:15,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Tenacity...</font>

217
00:17:16,470 --> 00:17:17,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hatred...</font>

218
00:17:18,680 --> 00:17:20,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Everything!</font>

219
00:17:27,480 --> 00:17:29,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But, let's see...</font>

220
00:17:31,110 --> 00:17:33,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I suppose just the fact
that you survived</font>

221
00:17:33,110 --> 00:17:35,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">might mean you have some value...</font>

222
00:17:38,370 --> 00:17:42,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Say? Do you want to come with me...?</font>

223
00:18:10,650 --> 00:18:11,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I see...</font>

224
00:18:14,030 --> 00:18:17,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll find a better gifted child then...</font>

225
00:18:34,880 --> 00:18:36,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It connected...</font>

226
00:18:47,020 --> 00:18:47,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So bright...</font>

227
00:18:51,310 --> 00:18:52,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I wasn't cast aside...</font>

228
00:18:54,650 --> 00:18:56,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I, on my own...</font>

229
00:18:57,570 --> 00:18:58,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">by my own will... chose it!</font>

230
00:19:06,700 --> 00:19:10,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, hey, where did Sensei go?</font>

231
00:19:10,290 --> 00:19:12,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">When I woke up this morning
she wasn't here...</font>

232
00:19:12,460 --> 00:19:13,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Leaving behind only a note like this!</font>

233
00:19:14,000 --> 00:19:14,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Will be right back! Anko</font>

234
00:19:14,960 --> 00:19:18,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Seriously...
She sure is a fidgety person!</font>

235
00:19:18,630 --> 00:19:20,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What did you say?
Who do you think you are?</font>

236
00:19:20,720 --> 00:19:22,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Whaddya mean?!</font>

237
00:19:22,180 --> 00:19:23,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What, you object?!</font>

238
00:19:26,970 --> 00:19:30,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Really... Can I come with you?</font>

239
00:19:31,980 --> 00:19:32,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't worry!</font>

240
00:19:33,230 --> 00:19:34,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's a very scary,</font>

241
00:19:34,520 --> 00:19:38,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">but awesome Medical Ninja
in Village Hidden in the Leaves!</font>

242
00:19:38,530 --> 00:19:42,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes, because Tsunade-sama
is a medical specialist.</font>

243
00:19:42,450 --> 00:19:45,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's right, Tsunade-sama is amazing!</font>

244
00:19:45,280 --> 00:19:46,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Surely she'll do something for you!</font>

245
00:19:47,330 --> 00:19:50,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Relax and let us take care of it.</font>

246
00:19:51,460 --> 00:19:52,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Thank you.</font>

247
00:19:54,210 --> 00:19:56,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, all of you!</font>

248
00:19:57,340 --> 00:20:00,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What are you doing?!
The boat will leave!</font>

249
00:20:00,670 --> 00:20:01,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">When did you...!</font>

250
00:20:02,090 --> 00:20:03,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What were you doing?!</font>

251
00:20:03,840 --> 00:20:05,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We've been waiting for you
this whole time, Sensei.</font>

252
00:20:06,220 --> 00:20:08,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sorry, sorry...</font>

253
00:20:11,310 --> 00:20:13,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wait! We're getting on!</font>

254
00:20:23,240 --> 00:20:26,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Okay! We're going home
to the Leaf Village!</font>

255
00:20:26,910 --> 00:20:31,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No doubt, you are hyper
from the start to the finish...</font>

256
00:20:31,580 --> 00:20:33,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Do you know what being tired is?</font>

257
00:20:33,870 --> 00:20:35,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Any problem?</font>

258
00:20:36,170 --> 00:20:38,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm praising you! I appreciate it!</font>

259
00:20:39,130 --> 00:20:43,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh? Really?
You're embarrassing me.</font>

260
00:21:20,810 --> 00:21:24,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Neucha"><font size="30"><b>kaze ga fuite aa</b></font></font></font>

261
00:21:20,810 --> 00:21:24,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Neucha"><font size="30"><b>the wind blows</b></font></font></font>

262
00:21:24,190 --> 00:21:27,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Neucha"><font size="30"><b>itai kienai omoi</b></font></font></font>

263
00:21:24,190 --> 00:21:27,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Neucha"><font size="30"><b>the pain, the memories won't disappear</b></font></font></font>

264
00:21:27,690 --> 00:21:30,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Neucha"><font size="30"><b>nani wo motte ikou ka</b></font></font></font>

265
00:21:27,690 --> 00:21:30,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Neucha"><font size="30"><b>what should be brought along?</b></font></font></font>

266
00:21:30,690 --> 00:21:34,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Neucha"><font size="30"><b>atsumete hitotsu</b></font></font></font>

267
00:21:30,690 --> 00:21:34,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Neucha"><font size="30"><b>assemble them into a piece</b></font></font></font>

268
00:21:34,030 --> 00:21:37,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Neucha"><font size="30"><b>nido to nai nido to nai</b></font></font></font>

269
00:21:34,030 --> 00:21:37,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Neucha"><font size="30"><b>there is no second chance, never</b></font></font></font>

270
00:21:37,260 --> 00:21:40,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Neucha"><font size="30"><b>suteru nante baka mitai</b></font></font></font>

271
00:21:37,260 --> 00:21:40,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Neucha"><font size="30"><b>how foolish it is to throw away</b></font></font></font>

272
00:21:40,470 --> 00:21:43,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Neucha"><font size="30"><b>mujaki ni natte aa</b></font></font></font>

273
00:21:40,470 --> 00:21:43,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Neucha"><font size="30"><b>acting so innocently</b></font></font></font>

274
00:21:43,500 --> 00:21:44,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Neucha"><font size="30"><b>imeeji</b></font></font></font>

275
00:21:43,500 --> 00:21:44,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Neucha"><font size="30"><b>the images</b></font></font></font>

276
00:21:47,210 --> 00:21:51,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Neucha"><font size="30"><b>kitto sore wa owaranai</b></font></font></font>

277
00:21:47,210 --> 00:21:51,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Neucha"><font size="30"><b>it probably will not end</b></font></font></font>

278
00:21:54,050 --> 00:21:58,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Neucha"><font size="30"><b>kitto sore wa owaranai</b></font></font></font>

279
00:21:54,050 --> 00:21:58,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Neucha"><font size="30"><b>it probably will not end</b></font></font></font>

280
00:22:00,090 --> 00:22:02,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Neucha"><font size="30"><b>ai no mune kogase</b></font></font></font>

281
00:22:00,090 --> 00:22:02,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Neucha"><font size="30"><b>burn that love-filled heart</b></font></font></font>

282
00:22:02,990 --> 00:22:06,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Neucha"><font size="30"><b>sen no yume watare</b></font></font></font>

283
00:22:02,990 --> 00:22:06,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Neucha"><font size="30"><b>sail across a thousand dreams</b></font></font></font>

284
00:22:06,290 --> 00:22:09,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Neucha"><font size="30"><b>juuoumujin kakete</b></font></font></font>

285
00:22:06,290 --> 00:22:09,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Neucha"><font size="30"><b>running freely</b></font></font></font>

286
00:22:09,100 --> 00:22:13,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Neucha"><font size="30"><b>te ni tsukamu sekai</b></font></font></font>

287
00:22:09,100 --> 00:22:13,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Neucha"><font size="30"><b>to take hold of the world in hand</b></font></font></font>

